{
  "name": "00 - LINE Users Sync",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "line-users-events",
        "responseMode": "onReceived",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "a28f1492-9d31-4a88-bada-a4a028769613",
      "name": "POST LINE Webhook",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [0, 0],
      "webhookId": "50e284db-2176-40cd-987e-eeb4014fa558",
      "notesInFlow": true,
      "notes": "นำ Production URL ไปใส่ใน LINE Developers > Messaging API > Webhook URL"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const request = $input.first().json;\nconst body = request.body || request;\nconst events = Array.isArray(body.events) ? body.events : [];\nconst supported = new Set(['follow', 'message', 'postback', 'unfollow']);\nconst latestByUid = new Map();\n\nfor (const event of events) {\n  const uid = String(event?.source?.userId || '').trim();\n  if (!uid || !supported.has(event.type)) continue;\n  const timestamp = Number(event.timestamp || Date.now());\n  const current = latestByUid.get(uid);\n  if (!current || timestamp >= current.timestamp) {\n    latestByUid.set(uid, {\n      LINE_UID: uid,\n      Event_Type: event.type,\n      Event_ID: String(event.webhookEventId || ''),\n      timestamp,\n      Event_At: new Date(timestamp).toISOString(),\n      Is_Active: event.type !== 'unfollow',\n    });\n  }\n}\n\nreturn [...latestByUid.values()].map(json => ({ json }));"
      },
      "id": "2ad5c198-9488-42f3-9329-e56c419a05fd",
      "name": "Extract User Events",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [240, 0],
      "notesInFlow": true,
      "notes": "รองรับ follow, message, postback และ unfollow; รวม event ซ้ำของ UID เดียวกันในคำขอเดียว"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "1aKwY4KOo8uGCRrHASD539Habt5Obam8meacRO-ir0Ks",
          "mode": "list",
